# Easterly Winds' 10094 finish with option 1: ten Imperial Bronze Pieces given, then completed. With a full bag
# (fill-inventory): npcUtil.giveItem fails: not completed (still current); room again: option 1: the pieces, completed.
lists RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10094
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=0,3,20 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau EasterlyWinds current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
fill-inventory                          # a GM: a full bag
walk 0,3,50                             # area 1: 10094
finish option=1                         # the bag full: not completed
free-inventory                          # a GM: room
walk 0,3,20
walk 0,3,50                             # 10094 again
finish option=1                         # the pieces, completed
